@backendUrl = https://localhost:7289
@internalHrEmail = admin@gmail.com
@internalHrPassword =111111Aa@
@failedApplicationId =def0fb57-4ea2-4044-a2ea-738eba5951c2

# Retry a FAILED MF-03 attempt without submitting the CV again.
# Prerequisites:
# 1. Restart HR Connect once so the permission seed is applied.
# 2. Login with INTERNAL_HR or PLATFORM_ADMIN that has application.retry_ai_scoring.
# 3. failedApplicationId has a latest AI attempt with status FAILED.

### TC-R01 - Internal HR login; expect HTTP 200
# @name internalHrLogin
POST {{backendUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{internalHrEmail}}",
  "password": "{{internalHrPassword}}"
}

### TC-R02 - Queue a retry; expect HTTP 202 and aiStatus=PENDING
POST {{backendUrl}}/api/v1/internal/applications/{{failedApplicationId}}/ai-scoring/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{internalHrLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### TC-R03 - The same retry cannot be queued twice; expect HTTP 409
POST {{backendUrl}}/api/v1/internal/applications/{{failedApplicationId}}/ai-scoring/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{internalHrLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

